From: krab3000 <336138103+krab3000@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:24:32 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Cove: mpv master + FFmpeg n9.0.2, built in Docker,
 verified

- depinfo: mpv a2cd83c (with mpv PR #18453), FFmpeg n9.0.2, libplacebo
  v7.360.1 (now required), dav1d 1.5.4, libass 0.17.5, freetype 2.14.3,
  fribidi 1.0.17, harfbuzz 14.5.0, mbedtls 3.6.7, libxml2 2.15.4; NDK r30,
  API level 24. Every source pinned (commit or sha256), GitHub mirrors
- libplacebo built static with libc++ linked in; mpv: one LGPL libmpv.so,
  GLES/EGL on Android, the media NDK (aimagereader) and the audio outputs
  required; mpv_lavc_set_java_vm patch rebased; FFmpeg patches dropped
  (in n9.0.2), --disable-postproc dropped (gone in FFmpeg 9)
- No Android SDK, Java or Gradle: the helper is built with the NDK's clang
- build.sh skips dependencies built with the same version and script
- bundle_default.sh: jars as media_kit expects, sums, versions.txt;
  verify.sh checks layout, sonames, NEEDED, exports (v1.1.7's), 16 KB pages,
  versions
- docker/: Dockerfile (pinned Ubuntu, meson 1.12.1, NDK r30 checked), run.sh

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
